        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Standards and Do as You’re Taught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bow your head. Curl your tail. Smile when it hurts. You’ll follow rules so twisted they gnaw at your mind. Every choice is a gamble, every success a nail in the coffin of your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cats With Standards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven hidden object descent into madness. Non-stress gameplay which still claw through the sinister truth of a world that demands you to obey. The darker the rules, the darker the secrets and the more you’ll wonder if you ever belonged at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden Object</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones. Yes, bones. Find them to continue. They don’t belong to the cats, but they obey anyway. A society so warped, even their appetites aren’t their own. Each hidden fragment adds to the grotesque mosaic of your crumbling reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dystopian nightmare dripping in fur and fangs. Find yourself laughing when you're supposed to cry. The original soundtrack gnaws at your mind, dragging you deeper into a world where the laughter feels wrong, and silence is worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel of fractured choices and splintered realities. Every decision shifts your fate, weaving a web of endings that tighten around you. Choose carefully—rebellion might hurt, but obedience will destroy you completely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No AI Used in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All parts of the game is hand-made by a solo game developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Small game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats With Standards is a short visual novel, with minimal gameplay. Take a cup of your favorite refreshment, sit back and relax while following the story. It takes approximately 1-2 hours to complete the game, depending on your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Solo Game Developer: Jestercraft. The journey of <i>“Shipping 24 Games in 24 Months.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/468dbf7a2745c91256ce2512a9db5988.avif?t=1782905344\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Standards and Do as You’re Taught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bow your head. Curl your tail. Smile when it hurts. You’ll follow rules so twisted they gnaw at your mind. Every choice is a gamble, every success a nail in the coffin of your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cats With Standards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven hidden object descent into madness. Non-stress gameplay which still claw through the sinister truth of a world that demands you to obey. The darker the rules, the darker the secrets and the more you’ll wonder if you ever belonged at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden Object</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones. Yes, bones. Find them to continue. They don’t belong to the cats, but they obey anyway. A society so warped, even their appetites aren’t their own. Each hidden fragment adds to the grotesque mosaic of your crumbling reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dystopian nightmare dripping in fur and fangs. Find yourself laughing when you're supposed to cry. The original soundtrack gnaws at your mind, dragging you deeper into a world where the laughter feels wrong, and silence is worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel of fractured choices and splintered realities. Every decision shifts your fate, weaving a web of endings that tighten around you. Choose carefully—rebellion might hurt, but obedience will destroy you completely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No AI Used in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All parts of the game is hand-made by a solo game developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Small game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats With Standards is a short visual novel, with minimal gameplay. Take a cup of your favorite refreshment, sit back and relax while following the story. It takes approximately 1-2 hours to complete the game, depending on your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Solo Game Developer: Jestercraft. The journey of <i>“Shipping 24 Games in 24 Months.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/468dbf7a2745c91256ce2512a9db5988.avif?t=1782905344\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Horror Visual Novel where Cats claw through filth for bones and whisper lies to mirrors. Find the Hidden-Objects, obey, smile, and repeat until the lines between rule and ruin blur, and you’re left meowing into the void.",
